---
// UC-05: a meeting shrinks Friday's slot, Adapta proposes a fix.
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-28">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="reveal max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">When plans change</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">A meeting just ate your session. Adapta has a plan B.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        When something new lands in your calendar, Adapta notices, tells you and offers a fix. It always
        protects the session that matters most.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid items-stretch gap-4 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr_auto_1fr]">
      <article class="reveal rounded-card bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">Planned</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Fri · 17:00–19:00</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">Brick: 75 min bike + 20 min run</p>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand"></div>
      </article>

      <Icon name="arrow" class="hidden size-5 self-center text-muted md:block" />

      <article class="reveal rounded-card bg-white p-6 shadow-soft ring-2 ring-coral/60">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
          <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-coral"></span> Conflict
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">New meeting · 17:00–18:00</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-semibold">"Your Friday slot is now 1 h."</p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full">
          <span class="w-1/2 bg-coral"></span><span class="w-1/2 bg-surface"></span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <Icon name="arrow" class="hidden size-5 self-center text-muted md:block" />

      <article class="reveal rounded-card bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary-ink">
          <Icon name="check" class="size-4" /> Adapted
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><span class="text-muted">Fri 18:00–19:00 ·</span> <span class="font-semibold">Short brick, 40 + 15 min</span></li>
          <li class="text-muted">or move the long ride to a free weekend slot</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
